### Key design decisions

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| `??` (nullish coalescing) instead of `\|\|` | Avoids treating an explicit empty string as falsy when you *want* to catch it separately |
| `parseInt(..., 10)` with explicit radix | Prevents octal/hex surprises from leading zeros |
| `Object.freeze` | Makes the exported object immutable so no consumer can silently corrupt shared state |
| Sanity checks at load time | Fails fast with a clear message rather than producing cryptic errors deep in the call stack |
| `NODE_ENV === "development"` auto-enables debug | Common convention; keeps local dev ergonomic without extra env vars |

