### Key design decisions

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| `process.env` overrides | Lets the same code run in dev, staging, and production without changes |
| `??` (nullish coalescing) | Falls back to the default only when the env var is `undefined` or `null`, not when it is an empty string |
| Explicit `Number()` cast | Environment variables are always strings; casting makes intent clear and avoids silent `NaN` bugs |
| `"false".toLowerCase() === "true"` | Treats any value other than the string `"true"` as `false`, preventing surprises |
| Startup validation | Fails fast with a descriptive message rather than crashing mysteriously later |
| `Object.freeze` | Prevents accidental mutation of a shared singleton config object |

