| Code | Label | Category |
|------|-------|----------|
| `200` | OK | ✅ Success |
| `301` | Moved Permanently | 🔀 Redirection |
| `404` | Not Found | ⚠️ Client Error |
| `500` | Internal Server Error | ❌ Server Error |

- **Keys are numbers** — access them with bracket notation (`statusLabels[200]`), not dot notation
- The function returns a **new object each call**, keeping it free of shared mutable state
- Easily **extensible** — add more codes by inserting additional key-value pairs

